📘 Madhuram API Documentation – Inventory Management Module
Overview
The Inventory API in Madhuram manages inventory items for projects, including:
Creating inventory items
Fetching inventory items (all / by project / by ID)
Updating inventory items
Deleting inventory items
✅ Base URL: /api/inventory
✅ Database Table: inventories
✅ Foreign key validation: project_id (error code 23503 → invalid project)

