Example Request
{
  "project_id": 10,
  "brand": "ACC",
  "quantity": 50,
  "name": "Cement Bag",
  "price": 350,
  "stockin": true
}

Success Response (201)
Returns the created inventory item:
{
  "inventory_id": 1,
  "project_id": 10,
  "brand": "ACC",
  "quantity": 50,
  "name": "Cement Bag",
  "price": 350,
  "stockin": true,
  "created_at": "2026-02-18T10:00:00.000Z"
}

Error Responses
400 – Invalid project_id (project does not exist)
{ "error": "Invalid project_id: Project does not exist" }

500 – Internal server error
{ "error": "Internal Server Error" }


2) Get All Inventory Items
GET /api/inventory
Fetches all inventory items ordered by latest created first.
Success Response (200)
Returns array of inventory items:
[
  {
    "inventory_id": 1,
    "project_id": 10,
    "brand": "ACC",
    "quantity": 50,
    "name": "Cement Bag",
    "price": 350,
    "stockin": true,
    "created_at": "2026-02-18T10:00:00.000Z"
  }
]

Error Response (500)
{ "error": "Internal Server Error" }


